DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_EA89_9BAC';
<p>ea89_9bac</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene F</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #a32d36;"><i>fuzzy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene F</span> is covered in a dense layer of hairs, giving it a soft appearance.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #006e59;">Gene M</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #006e59;"><i>mushy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006e59;">Gene M</span> feels soft to the touch and unusually squishy, unlike the usual firmness.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene X</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>xanthic</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene X</span> has a fluorescent bright yellow coloring.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy, mushy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,023</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy, mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">11,994</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">25,474</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">61,763</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">61,611</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">25,172</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">11,932</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,031</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">200,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>M</b> and <b>F</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>M</b> and <b>F</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_EA89_9BAC
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(1,023 + 1,031 + 11,932 + 11,994)</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = <sup>25,980</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = 0.1299 = <strong>12.99 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(1,023 + 1,031 + 11,932 + 25,172)</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = <sup>39,158</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = 0.1958 = <strong>19.58 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(1,023 + 1,031 + 25,172 + 25,474)</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = <sup>52,700</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = 0.2635 = <strong>26.35 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(1,031 + 11,994 + 25,474 + 61,763)</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = <sup>100,262</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = 0.5013 = <strong>50.13 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(11,932 + 11,994 + 25,172 + 25,474)</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = <sup>74,572</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = 0.3729 = <strong>37.29 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(61,611 + 61,763)</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = <sup>123,374</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = 0.6169 = <strong>61.69 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(1,023 + 1,031 + 11,932 + 11,994)</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = <sup>25,980</sup>/<sub>200,000</sub> = 0.1299 = <strong>12.99 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EA89_9BAC_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
